OL,3,AArmy officer killed by reversing
OL,4,AWarrior with faulty alarm - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FLt Col Graham Watson, who led a service
OL,7,Finquiry into the incident, said the
OL,8,Fdriver of the Warrior "would have
OL,9,Falmost certainly stopped" if the alarm
OL,10,Fhad sounded.
